ues are: \n2 = Quarantine  \n3 = Remove  \n6 = Ignore","legacy_ids":["SV-94669","V-79965"],"mitigations":"","security_override_guidance":"","group_id_src":"V-213464","severity":"medium","rule_id":"SV-213464r961086","weight":"10.0","uuid":"947C3E40-6BF8-1014-A3D6-DF750E30FDEB","responsibility":"","group_title":"SRG-APP-000207","mitigation_control":"","rule_title":"Microsoft Defender AV must be configured for automatic remediation action to be taken for threat alert level High.","comments":null,"status":"not_a_finding","false_positives":"","third_party_tools":"","documentable":"false","fix_text":"Set the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; Threats &gt;&gt; \"Specify threat alert levels at which default action should not be taken when detected\" to \"Enabled\". \n\nSelect the \"Showâ¦\" option box and enter \"4\" in the \"Value name\" field and enter \"2\" in the \"Value\" field.","group_id":"V-213464","check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.defenderantivirus:def:40","href":"U_MS_Defender_Antivirus_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV14-oval.xml"},"finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T10:13:22\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :   true (Computer Configuration\\Administrative Templates\\Windows Components\\Microsoft Defender Antivirus\\Threats\\Specify threat alert levels at which default action should not be taken when detected-High)\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.stig.defenderantivirus:tst:40000 (registry_test)\nResult                  : true\nTest Title              : Computer Configuration\\Administrative Templates\\Windows Components\\Microsoft Defender Antivirus\\Threats\\Specify threat alert levels at which default action should not be taken when detected-High\nCheck Existence       