oit Guard\\ASR\\Rules\n\nCriteria: If the value \"c1db55ab-c21a-4637-bb3f-a12568109d35\" is REG_SZ = 1, this is not a finding.\n\nIf the value is other than 1, this is a finding.","ccis":["CCI-001170"],"group_tree":{"id":"V-278650","title":"SRG-APP-000210"},"rule_id_src":"SV-278650r1190732_rule","ia_controls":"","rule_version":"WNDF-AV-000046","stig_uuid":"94765B2D-6BF8-1014-890D-C12B2755253C","potential_impacts":"","severity":"medium","group_id_src":"V-278650","security_override_guidance":"","mitigations":"","legacy_ids":[],"discussion":"This policy setting provides an extra layer of protection against ransomware. It uses both client and cloud heuristics to determine whether a file resembles ransomware. This rule does not block files that have one or more of the following characteristics:\n\n- The file is found to be unharmful in the Microsoft cloud.\n- The file is a valid signed file.\n- The file is prevalent enough to not be considered as ransomware.\n- The rule tends to err on the side of caution to prevent ransomware.","reference_identifier":"3985","classification":"Unclassified","weight":"10.0","rule_id":"SV-278650r1190732","group_title":"SRG-APP-000210","responsibility":"","uuid":"947C5DD6-6BF8-1014-93C9-FEF666AB4EEE"},{"status":"open","false_positives":"","third_party_tools":"","documentable":"false","fix_text":"Set the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Exploit Guard &gt;&gt; Attack Surface Reduction &gt;&gt; Configure Attack Surface Reduction rules to \"Enabled\".\n\nUnder the policy option \"Set the state for each ASR rule:\", then click \"Show\".\n\nEnter GUID \"d1e49aac-8f56-4280-b9ba-993a6d77406c\" in the \"Value Name\" column.\n\nEnter \"2\" in the \"Value\" column.","mitigation_control":"","rule_title":"Microsoft Defender AV must audit process creations originating from PSExec and WMI commands.","comments":null,"group_t