:def:278660","href":"U_MS_Defender_Antivirus_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV14-oval.xml"},"group_id":"V-278660","ccis":["CCI-001170"],"check_content":"Verify the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Windows Security &gt;&gt; Family Options &gt;&gt; Hide the Family options area is set to \"Enabled\"; otherwise, this is a finding.\n\nProcedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: \nHKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender Security Center\\Family options\n\nCriteria: If the value \"UILockdown\" is REG_DWORD = 1, this is not a finding.\n\nIf the value is 0, this is a finding.","group_tree":{"id":"V-278660","title":"SRG-APP-000210"},"comments":null,"mitigation_control":"","rule_title":"Microsoft Defender AV must hide the Family options area.","documentable":"false","fix_text":"Set the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Windows Security &gt;&gt; Family Options &gt;&gt; Hide the Family options area to \"Enabled\".","third_party_tools":"","false_positives":"","status":"open","rule_id":"SV-278660r1190750","weight":"10.0","group_title":"SRG-APP-000210","responsibility":"","uuid":"947C8B42-6BF8-1014-AF1E-A94D5A9C98D7","rule_id_src":"SV-278660r1190750_rule","ia_controls":"","rule_version":"WNDF-AV-000056","stig_uuid":"94765B2D-6BF8-1014-890D-C12B2755253C","potential_impacts":"","severity":"medium","group_id_src":"V-278660","security_override_guidance":"","legacy_ids":[],"mitigations":"","reference_identifier":"3985","classification":"Unclassified","discussion":"The Family options section contains links to settings and further information for parents of a Windows PC. It is not intended for enterprise or business environments.\n\nThis section can be hidden from users of the machine. This option can be useful if you do not want users in the organization to see or have access to this section."},{"third_party_tools":"","documentable":"false","fix_text":"Set the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; MpEngine &gt;&gt;Enable file hash computation feature to \"Enabled\".","status":"open","false_positives":"","comments":null,"mitigation_control":"","rule_title":"Microsoft Defender AV must enable the file hash computation feature.","group_tree":{"id":"V-278661","title":"SRG-APP-000210"},"ccis":["CCI-001170"],"check_content":"Verify the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; MpEngine &gt;&gt; Enable file hash computation feature is set to \"Enabled\"; otherwise, this is a finding.\n\nProcedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: \nHKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\n\nCriteria: If the value \"EnableFileHashComputation\" is REG_DWORD = 1, this is not a finding.\n\nIf the value is 0, this is a finding.","group_id":"V-278661","check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.windowsdefav:def:278661","href":"U_MS_Defender_Antivirus_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV14-oval.xml"},"finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T10:13:22\nResult: failRule Result             : Fail\nCriteria                : false (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :   false (Enable file hash computation feature' is 'Enabled')\nResult Analysis         :        Registry Name Not found: 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\\EnableFileHashComputation'.  Existence requirement is 'at_least_one_exists' and no items were collected, so result is false.\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:tst:27866100 (registry_test)\nResult                  : false\nTest Title              : Enable file hash computation feature' is 'Enabled'\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:obj:27866100 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : \nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'EnableFileHashComputation'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:ste:20000001 (registry_state)\nState Comment           : \nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'type' must be equal to 'reg_dword'\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'value' must be equal to '1'\n\nResult Analysis         : Registry Name Not found: 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\\EnableFileHashComputation'.  Existence requirement is 'at_least_one_exists' and no items were collected, so result is false.\n","security_override_guidance":"","group_id_src":"V-278661","severity":"medium","classification":"Unclassified","reference_identifier":"3985","discussion":"This policy drives the ability to enforce Indicators of Compromise (IoC) by using file hash allow/block indicators.","legacy_ids":[],"mitigations":"","rule_version":"WNDF-AV-000057","ia_controls":"","rule_id_src":"SV-278661r1190752_rule","stig_uuid":"94765B2D-6BF8-1014-890D-C12B2755253C","potential_impacts":"","group_title":"SRG-APP-000210","uuid":"947C8FC9-6BF8-1014-84AC-9C479644EE9E","responsibility":"","rule_id":"SV-278661r1190752","weight":"10.0"},{"status":"open","false_positives":"","third_party_tools":"","fix_text":"Set the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; MpEngine &gt;&gt; Configure extended cloud check to \"Enabled\" with a Policy Option value of \"50\".","documentable":"false","rule_title":"Microsoft Defender AV must enable extended cloud check.","mitigation_control":"","comments":null,"group_tree":{"id":"V-278662","title":"SRG-APP-000210"},"ccis":["CCI-001170"],"check_content":"Verify the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; MpEngine &gt;&gt; Configure extended cloud check is set to \"Enabled\" with a Policy Option value of \"50\"; otherwise, this is a finding.\n\nProcedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: \nHKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\n\nCriteria: If the value \"MpBafsExtendedTimeout\" is REG_DWORD = 50, this is not a finding.\n\nIf the value is other than 50, this is a finding.","group_id":"V-278662","check_content_ref":{"href":"U_MS_Defender_Antivirus_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV14-oval.xml","name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.windowsdefav:def:278662"},"finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T10:13:22\nResult: failRule Result             : Fail\nCriteria                : false (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :   false (MpBafsExtendedTimeout == 50)\nResult Analysis         :        Registry Name Not found: 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\\MpBafsExtendedTimeout'.  Existence requirement is 'at_least_one_exists' and no items were collected, so result is false.\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:tst:27866200 (registry_test)\nResult                  : false\nTest Title              : MpBafsExtendedTimeout == 50\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:obj:27866200 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : \nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'MpBafsExtendedTimeout'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:ste:27866200 (registry_state)\nState Comment           : \nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'type' must be equal to 'reg_dword'\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'value' must be equal to '50'\n\nResult Analysis         : Registry Name Not found: 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\\MpBafsExtendedTimeout'.  Existence requirement is 'at_least_one_exists' and no items were collected, so result is false.\n","reference_identifier":"3985","discussion":"When Microsoft Defender Antivirus finds a suspicious file, it can prevent the file from running while it queries the Microsoft Defender Antivirus cloud service.\n\nThe default period that the file is blocked is 10 seconds. Extending the cloud block timeout period can help ensure there is enough time to receive a proper determination from the Microsoft Defender Antivirus cloud service.","classification":"Unclassified","legacy_ids":[],"mitigations":"","security_override_guidance":"","severity":"medium","group_id_src":"V-278662","potential_impacts":"","stig_uuid":"94765B2D-6BF8-1014-890D-C12B2755253C","ia_controls":"","rule_version":"WNDF-AV-000058","rule_id_src":"SV-278662r1190754_rule","uuid":"947C944A-6BF8-1014-8A05-EB37166C756B","responsibility":"","group_title":"SRG-APP-000210","weight":"10.0","rule_id":"SV-278662r1190754"},{"ccis":["CCI-002624"],"check_content":"