Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: \nHKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Features\n\nCriteria: If the value \"PassiveRemediation\" is REG_DWORD = 1, this is not a finding.\n\nIf the value is 0, this is a finding.","ccis":["CCI-001170"],"potential_impacts":"","stig_uuid":"94765B2D-6BF8-1014-890D-C12B2755253C","rule_version":"WNDF-AV-000070","ia_controls":"","rule_id_src":"SV-278674r1190763_rule","reference_identifier":"3985","discussion":"EDR in block mode allows Microsoft Defender Antivirus to take actions on post-breach, behavioral EDR detections. EDR in block mode is integrated with threat and vulnerability management capabilities. ","classification":"Unclassified","legacy_ids":[],"mitigations":"","security_override_guidance":"","group_id_src":"V-278674","severity":"medium","rule_id":"SV-278674r1190763","weight":"10.0","uuid":"947CA5D4-6BF8-1014-A7B9-A3E45F66D4DC","responsibility":"","group_title":"SRG-APP-000210"},{"group_tree":{"id":"V-278675","title":"SRG-APP-000210"},"ccis":["CCI-001170"],"check_content":"Verify the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; Reporting &gt;&gt; Configure whether to report Dynamic Signature dropped events is set to \"Enabled\"; otherwise, this is a finding.\n\nProcedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: \nHKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Reporting\n\nCriteria: If the value \"EnableDynamicSignatureDroppedEventReporting\" is REG_DWORD = 1, this is not a finding.\n\nIf the value is 0, this is a finding.","group_id":"V-278675","check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:mil.disa.stig.windowsdefav:def:278675","href":"U_MS_Defender_Antivirus_V2R8_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV14-oval.xml"},"finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T10:13:22\nResult: failRule Result             : Fail\nCriteria          