 One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:obj:27886300 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : \nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal (case insensitive) to 'MpCloudBlockLevel'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:ste:20000002 (registry_state)\nState Comment           : \nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'type' must be equal to 'reg_dword'\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'value' must be equal to '2'\n\nResult Analysis         : Registry Name Not found: 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\\MpCloudBlockLevel'.  Existence requirement is 'at_least_one_exists' and no items were collected, so result is false.\n","group_tree":{"id":"V-278863","title":"SRG-APP-000210"},"check_content":"Verify the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; Microsoft Defender Antivirus &gt;&gt; MpEngine &gt;&gt; Select cloud protection level is set to \"Enabled\". Verify the policy value for \"Select cloud blocking level\" is set to \"High blocking level\"; otherwise, this is a finding.\n\nProcedure: Use the Windows Registry Editor to navigate to the following key: \nHKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\MpEngine\n\nCriteria: If the value \"MpCloudBlockLevel\" is REG_DWORD = 2, this is not a finding.\n\nIf the value is other than 2, this is a finding.","ccis":["CCI-001170"],"comments":null,"rule_title":"Microsoft Defender AV must set cloud protection level to High.","mitig